[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4501.63, "timestamp": "01:15:01", "text": "烦恼，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4504.149, "timestamp": "01:15:04", "text": "但我认为……我不知道。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4507.03, "timestamp": "01:15:07", "text": "知道。我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4516.87, "timestamp": "01:15:16", "text": "让他停下来。好的。嘿，所以那不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4520.63, "timestamp": "01:15:20", "text": "太糟糕了。我的天啊。各位，让我说几句。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4521.95, "timestamp": "01:15:21", "text": "所以对于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4525.189, "timestamp": "01:15:25", "text": "例如，Saskcape 正好在 Saskame 的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4527.59, "timestamp": "01:15:27", "text": "宣布和 Gen One，Zuchi 和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4530.709, "timestamp": "01:15:30", "text": "塞拉斯蒂娅也在那里，她们工作非常努力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4533.189, "timestamp": "01:15:33", "text": "在他们的内容和东西中"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4535.189, "timestamp": "01:15:35", "text": "观众和大家一起聚齐了，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4539.07, "timestamp": "01:15:39", "text": "慢慢来，慢慢来，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4542.39, "timestamp": "01:15:42", "text": "然后是阿提姆斯和完整的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4545.91, "timestamp": "01:15:45", "text": "零世代的另外三个人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4548.35, "timestamp": "01:15:48", "text": "或者禅宗来了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4551.99, "timestamp": "01:15:51", "text": "他们慢慢地、慢慢地做着他们的事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4553.83, "timestamp": "01:15:53", "text": "他们慢慢地建立起一些东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4556.87, "timestamp": "01:15:56", "text": "社区是对的，就是这样。"}]